# Runtime secrets/data and local-only documents are not part of the image build.
.env
.env.*
# 公开、已入库的示例模板必须保留，避免 Git 将构建目录误判为删除了源码文件。
!.env.example
config/
backups/
docs/
deploy/artifacts/
bin/
*.exe
*.log
*.tar.gz
# Keep .git in the builder stage for automatic metadata; the runtime stage copies only the binary.
